- **Cost:** Profit stays positive at stress cost on every pair. Stress profit is 79% to 89% of optimistic profit. I could not state the round-trip cost in percent because the scenario fee values are not in the files I read.
- **Concentration:** The five best trades make up about 99% of base profit on BTC, 130% on ETH and 123% on BNB. The rest of the trades net to roughly zero or lose money. BNB is the most concentrated. Its two early-2021 trades are 80% of its base profit.
- **Hit rate and exits:** Hit rate is 51% on BTC, 50% on ETH and 38% on BNB. Stop-loss exits number 1, 7 and 9 on BTC, ETH and BNB. BNB also has one forced exit at the end of the window.
